: Verify","Step 4: Offer sign-in (once, optional)","Step 5: Report"],"name_hint":"设置"},{"path":"skills/stack-depth/SKILL.md","name":"stack-depth","description":"Worst-case stack depth analysis for embedded C/C++/Rust/Go: call-graph traversal, per-function frame sizes, recursion detection, and stack budget pass/fail from compiled .o or linked ELF binaries.","headings":["LOCI Stack Depth Analysis","Step 1 — one call","Step 2 — classify the recursion (stack only)","Step 3 — judge what the CLI could not","Step 4 — report","Per-function report","Stack Depth: <FunctionName>","Artifact provenance (mandatory)","Warnings","A bare closing word requires a clean upper bound","Incremental comparison (when a baseline was measured)","Stack Frame Delta: <FunctionName>","Conclusion table","Row catalogue (order when present)","Example","Conclusion","Conclusion","Conclusion"],"name_hint":"stack · depth"},{"path":"skills/trends/SKILL.md","name":"trends","description":"Per-function measurement history on the current branch: timing, energy, stack, and memory trends over time from LOCI analysis.","headings":["LOCI Trends","Step 0: Check session context","Step 1: Retrieve trend summary","Step 2: Render the report","LOCI Trends: <branch_name>","Step 3: Single-function drill-down (optional)","<func_name>","LOCI voice remark"],"name_hint":"trends"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["LOCI","Prerequisites","Install","Quick Start","Skills","Verdicts","Hooks","Cockpit","Powered by AI Physics","Troubleshooting","loci CLI not installed","Analysis needs sign-in","LOCI says the project is not initialized","LOCI was not called / skills didn't trigger","Further Reading"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".gitattributes",".gitignore","CODEOWNERS","DPA.md","LICENSE.md","PORTAL.md","README.md","agents.txt","authorization-flow/AuthorizationFlow.md","authorization-flow/images/step-01-welcome-signin.png","auth